license: MIT

abstract: >
  Data analytics project built around ETVL pipelines: Extract, Transform,
  Verify, and Load. The same four-stage structure is applied across CSV,
  JSON, Excel, and plain text sources to show that a pipeline pattern can
  move between formats and between problem domains without rewriting the
  reusable pieces.

